xhSF6zjEWx8Q7kNvwENAGCy&_nc_oc=Adr0XcFDvb6oxw92X1QZenb2mauE_ei98z20uHkZsEX8p3mUJakOt7sCUqur311_FRQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1dIvodhkv2IS15aHfa6WHBujmLqynQ20xCQZZb-GrDxw&oe=69F606B7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vB5efEmQKakQ7kNvwH0C4My&_nc_oc=AdoVSr8o71E1LtkpFTqLkzsFCWTGB7MtXNJB_tlunH-cy3ZJfyRH-imOMvMfRrbxTR8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1um7mNrAzE9Vhq3GQKc1gGfaJCI_ZkPbYTnjWLGZk9sA&oe=69F6084A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wdcdyImg8awQ7kNvwEB24FX&_nc_oc=AdpLb5pCEMWa0fQ95MomHlPL1B07XVGSsnpi7wwtN_N1k6rasRG4hGrSjuKwx3i3sPc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2J5dxLXofF4yPHZBdX6rnta8myruGpQ54buScSO5CvTg&oe=69F5F56F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yVpf_bboqAUQ7kNvwGhF54H&_nc_oc=AdoGcG4yMFCOWuDEqdgL-jcNMGrNsNtibNhvjmok55nxg6lsaOOfmwBgJJTqEMh7t38&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1g1vrB0mj6K3VbuQ4s7nDrhgQqjm3zsG-v1QmpnAffXA&oe=69F61703"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=utFfMSmpZWoQ7kNvwHQeiwX&_nc_oc=AdqkWc8BcSkUaLB-wo_Of9bjnjQLuQN_tjRdDJ6G4OtiO3967DUoik5A0EpCQuMU-Fo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2NFGzt-IfF5VltBsWUygjsebD27CHeVIGFGPncFVkLUg&oe=69F60F58"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uDcyAk_DyXMQ7kNvwGkyWW3&_nc_oc=AdqPrdxu___kBlsOWGtr1r9KkFPTfPIZLibNxiz7nce7Bz2Z0HIIV-WTFW9fIB4qYqw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0gAACzMg1Me0SbPCBPDwzgzJmebQiNtby3z09DIn2umQ&oe=69F5EA3C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080